---
---
<section id="about" class="py-16 md:py-24 lg:py-28 px-5 md:px-12">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
    
    <div class="mb-12 md:mb-20 lg:mb-24 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-6 md:gap-12 justify-between items-start lg:items-end">
      <h2 data-animate="fade-up" class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-[3rem] font-bold tracking-[-0.03em] text-text-muted max-w-3xl leading-[1.1] md:leading-[1.05]">
        World-class gym equipment, <br> <span class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-[5rem] text-white">sourced globally.</span>
      </h2>
      <p data-animate="fade-up" style="--stagger:1" class="text-text-muted max-w-md text-base md:text-xl leading-relaxed font-medium">
        Fortura Global Exim is a licensed importing company and wholesale supplier of premium commercial gym equipment. We source directly from leading factories in China and Taiwan — handling customs clearance, logistics, and installation pan-India.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-5">
      
      <!-- Big Image Block -->
      <div data-animate="scale-in" class="lg:col-span-8 h-[350px] md:h-[600px] rounded-[2rem] md:rounded-[3rem] overflow-hidden relative group">
        <img 
          src="/images/gym-image-1.webp" 
          alt="Full commercial gym setup with imported strength equipment" 
          class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-[2s] ease-out"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-background via-background/30 to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 md:bottom-10 md:left-10 md:right-10">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent/10 backdrop-blur-sm mb-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
            <span class="text-accent text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase">Premium Equipment</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-white text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-2 tracking-tight">Commercial-Grade Gym Machines</p>
          <p class="text-white/60 text-sm md:text-lg font-medium max-w-lg">Strength machines, cardio equipment, functional rigs, dumbbells, and more — all imported from certified factories in China and Taiwan to meet international standards.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column Blocks -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col gap-5">
        
        <div data-animate="fade-up" style="--stagger:1" class="bg-surface rounded-[2rem] md:rounded-[3rem] p-8 md:p-10 flex-1 hover:bg-surface-hover transition-colors duration-300 flex flex-col justify-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center text-accent mb-5">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-[2rem] font-bold mb-3 md:mb-4 text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">Customer-First Approach</h3>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-6 md:mb-8 font-medium">
            Our friendly, knowledgeable team guides you from equipment selection through customs clearance to final installation. We're here to make your gym setup experience seamless and stress-free.
          </p>
         
        </div>

        <div data-animate="fade-up" style="--stagger:2" class="bg-accent rounded-[2rem] md:rounded-[3rem] p-8 md:p-10 h-auto md:h-[250px] flex flex-col justify-center text-black hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-5xl md:text-[4rem] font-black mb-2 tracking-tighter leading-none">500+</h3>
          <p class="text-black/70 font-bold text-base md:text-lg leading-tight">
            Gyms equipped with imported commercial machines across India.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
